   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF-SADC Capacity development intiative in education policy development, planning and management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Grant is to support the efforts of the SADC HRDCU to (a) develop effective capacity for education policy development, planning and management in  the SADC member states, (ii) establish mechanisms for capturing and exchanging information on availabe resources and expertise in policy development, planning and management across the sub-region, (iii) and establish mechanisms for documenting and sharing lessons of good practice</narrative>
